{
  "title": "The Mass Gap of Pure SU(N) Gauge Theory as a Finite-Aperture Effect",
  "description": "Pure SU(N) Yang-Mills has a mass gap because the vacuum is read through a finite aperture, which band-limits: the gap is the entropy margin Delta = kappa_0 - mu > 0 below the counting floor kappa_0 = (1/4) ln 3. This repository holds the paper, the Lean 4 / Mathlib verification, and the Entroptics analysis code.",
